  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder outperforms pca_n2000 in multiprofile setups (config_030: 0.6315 accuracy vs config_018: 0.6186). This experiment tests scvi_n200 in singleprofile setup (config_028) to isolate the effect of profile setting and RNA encoder choice. It clarifies whether scvi_n200's benefits are profile-agnostic or specific to multiprofile data, addressing uncertainty about representation impact while leveraging prior evidence of its effectiveness."
